  "statuteText": "259:52 Manufacturer. –\n\n\"Manufacturer,\" as used in the provisions of RSA 261 relative to registration, shall mean every person engaged in the business of constructing or assembling vehicles of a type required to be registered hereunder at an established place of business in this state."
